    2.164906
   ],
   "model": "batllo",
   "face": 44.7,
   "info": "Gaudí's remodelling of 1904-06 of a house on Passeig de Gràcia: the façade a ripple of trencadís and ceramic discs, the balconies masks of bone, the noble floor framed in sandstone bones, the roof a dragon's scaly back pierced by St George's cross. The \"house of bones\".",
   "depth": 50,
