   "at": [
    41.391551,
    2.165047
   ],
   "model": "amatller",
   "face": 44.7,
   "info": "Josep Puig i Cadafalch's house for the chocolatier Antoni Amatller, 1898-1900: a stepped Flemish gable of pink sgraffito and glazed tile. With the Batlló and the Lleó Morera it makes the Block of Discord, three architects arguing in one street.",
