   "model": "pedrera",
   "height": 27,
   "info": "Gaudí's last house, 1906-12, on the corner of Passeig de Gràcia and Provença: a cliff of limestone in waves - \"the quarry\", the city called it - with Jujol's wrought-iron balconies like seaweed, round two courtyards, and on the roof the stairheads and chimneys standing like helmeted warriors.",
