   ],
   "info": "Jean Nouvel's tower, 2005, built for the water company Agbar: 144 m and 38 floors in the shape of a geyser, its concrete shell clad in panels of 25 colours, reds at the foot to blues at the top, under a skin of glass louvres; 4,500 windows and as many LEDs, which light it at night."
  },
  {
