   ],
   "info": "Josep Vilaseca's gateway to the Universal Exhibition of 1888, in red brick in the Neo-Mudéjar manner, 30 m high. The frieze shows Barcelona welcoming the nations; the promenade of Lluís Companys runs through it to the Parc de la Ciutadella."
  },
  {
