   "model": "colom",
   "face": 125,
   "clear": [
    12,
    0
   ],
   "info": "Gaietà Buïgas's column for the Exhibition of 1888, at the foot of La Rambla where Columbus landed on his return from the first voyage: 60 m, eight bronze lions at its foot, and Columbus on the globe pointing out to sea - towards Mallorca, not America. A lift goes up inside to the gallery under his feet."
  },
